Package: ocelotlc
Architecture: any
Depends: libocelotlrt1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ocelotl tensor compiler
 Ocelotl is an experimental compiler implemented in modern C++.
 It provides lexical and syntactic analysis, semantic analysis,
 an SSA-inspired intermediate representation, LLVM IR generation,
 target assembly generation, and relocatable object-file emission.

Package: libocelotlrt1
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Ocelotl generated-program runtime library
 A small, versioned C ABI providing aligned storage and diagnostics for
 programs generated by the Ocelotl compiler.

Package: libocelotlrt-dev
Section: non-free/libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libocelotlrt1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for the Ocelotl runtime ABI
 Public versioned C headers, unversioned shared-library link, and static
 archive for linking programs generated by Ocelotl.
